// most, as read from manufacturer and distributor pages on 2026-09-16 (see
// US_CATALOG_VERIFIED_ON in ./usCatalog.ts). Each family names the page it
// came from; `verified: false` marks a family whose figures came from a
// listing title or a search snippet rather than a page that was read.
//
// Conventions (details in ./usCatalog.ts): a pattern read in full is used as
// is; "PREFIX-{size}" (hyphen) is the family plus the nominal size and the
// distributor's exact suffix goes in when the shop edits the row. Headline
// ratings are the family's "up to" figures — a matched system's real SEER2
// / HSPF2 comes from the AHRI directory (import it on the Catalog panel).
// Heat-pump capacities at 17 / 5 °F are the family's read share of rated or
// the rule-of-thumb share; the NEEP directory import carries the real curve.

